# `?` on an empty input shows the shortcuts panel (internal/tui/app.go
# line ~1132, internal/tui/shortcuts.go RenderShortcuts); any key dismisses
# it (app.go line ~1070's `if m.shortcuts { m.shortcuts = false ... }`).
@faux testdata/faux/hello.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE ?
SHOT shortcuts-panel
EXPECT /!\s+run a shell command\s+⇧⇥\s+cycle permission mode/
EXPECT /\/\s+commands\s+esc esc\s+rewind the conversation/
EXPECT /@\s+add files\s+ctrl\+o\s+verbose transcript/
EXPECT /#\s+save a memory note\s+ctrl\+f\s+fullscreen or inline/
EXPECT /shift\+⏎\s+new line\s+ctrl\+c ×2\s+exit/
KEY a
SHOT shortcuts-dismissed
EXPECT_NOT /run a shell command/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
